# Native host helpers for the Windows x64 desktop image:
#   supermux-broker.exe — the single cross-platform Bun broker
#   mux-sessiond.exe    — persistent ConPTY + Job Object owner
#   frpc.exe            — frp 0.61.1 relay client
# Windows never bundles tmux or pty-helper.
# Staged by scripts/stage-desktop-binaries.sh in CI before packageMsi. Never committed;
# this .gitignore keeps the dir tracked so appResourcesRootDir resolves.
*
!.gitignore
